    "title": "Woman arrested on domestic violence charges in Norwood - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Daniel Duric ,\n2 hours ago NORWOOD, NY — Norwood Village Police have arrested a Potsdam woman on domestic violence charges stemming from an incident that occurred on Nov. 5. Nichole Harmer, 43, was reportedly at the home of a female victim in the village without permission and in violation of an order of protection. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
